OfferingItemTooltip: This item can be offered at the blessing altar.
HerbTooltip: This herb can be used as a modifier at the blessing altar.
RejectedMessage: The Great Wyvern rejects your offering.

RadiantHeart: {
	Name: Radiant Heart
	Message: Your heart sings with hope. Take life in stride, young one.
	Bonus: 40% increased natural life regen.
}

Enchanted: {
	Name: Enchanted
	Message: May wonder run through thine fingers.
	Bonus: +6 Mana Regen
}

Attuned: {
	Name: Attuned
	Message: In peace, you will find the strength to recover, young one.
	Bonus: Up to +25 Mana Regen and 50% life regen depending on how slow you're moving.
}

OozingAffection: {
	Name: Oozing Affection
	Message: May the gooey sweetness of honey nurse your wounds, young one.
	Bonus: You have a chance to release bees when hurt and you get the honey buff when under 25% health.
}

Serenity: {
	Name: Serenity
	Message: Carry with you the calmness of the vast ocean and the meager puddle.
	Bonus: Increased Life and Mana regen when wind is low and it is not raining.
}

ThrivingDarkness: {
	Name: Thriving Darkness
	Message: Lurking just out of my reach. Stay safe in the dark, young one.
	Bonus: Increased Life regen in low-light conditions.
}

Decademce: {
	Name: Decademce
	Message: Gorge freely, for I can't stop you.
	Bonus: Food buffs are more affective.
}

Overgrown: {
	Name: Overgrown
	Message: Life shall teem around you, young one!
	Bonus: You make flowers on grass and get improved life and mana regen when in the Forest or the Jungle.
}

RejuvenatingWarmth: {
	Name: Rejuvenating Warmth
	Message: May heat's opression turn to embrace around you.
	Bonus: You make flowers on grass and get improved life and mana regen when in the Forest or the Jungle.
}

MilkyWayStride: {
	Name: Milky-Way Stride
	Message: The twinkling of the stars fuels your regeneration.
	Bonus: Holding Constitution or its upgrades boosts Life and Mana regen massively.
}

ScarletSurge: {
	Name: Scarlet Surge
	Message: Sanguine, both your blood and your bullets shall be.
	Bonus: +8% Ranged Damage
}

Clarity: {
	Name: Clarity
	Message: Your third eye is unblinded. Let its vision guide you.
	Bonus: +10% Magic Damage
}

Tempered: {
	Name: Tempered
	Message: Your past experiences will inform your future ones.
	Bonus: +12% All-class Damage
}

Alliegance: {
	Name: Alliegance
	Message: Your servants shall fall in line eagerly.
	Bonus: +10% Summon Damage
}

Waywashed: {
	Name: Waywashed
	Message: You will lose your way, but will have no trouble making a new way.
	Bonus: +14% Scepter Damage
}

Seething: {
	Name: Seething
	Message: Hate will clog your veins like tar, yet proves a powerful motivator.
	Bonus: +14% Scepter Damage
}

Bulk: {
	Name: Bulk
	Message: All that food you eat will serve your strength well.
	Bonus: +15% Melee Damage
}

LifeStricken: {
	Name: Life Stricken
	Message: The power of the jungle shall course through you!
	Bonus: +20% Magic Damage
}

FieryPassion: {
	Name: Fiery Passion
	Message: Let your rage burn, young one!!
	Bonus: +20% Throwing Damage
}

StarScorn: {
	Name: StarScorn
	Message: May the stars envigorate you, young one!!
	Bonus: +20% Sceper Damage
}
